# UI/UX PRO MAX SKILL PROTOCOL
Source: https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill

Whenever you touch or create frontend files in this project:
1. Always apply curated UI Styles, Harmonic Color Palettes, and Accessibility Rules from `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`.
2. Adhere to BEO Modern Fashion brand identity (Japanese minimalist aesthetic, `#e60012` accent, `#111111` typography, clean grid layout).
3. Ensure all interactive touch targets are >= 44x44px, contrast ratio >= 4.5:1, and mobile-first responsive.
4. Execute `node .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.js "<topic>"` if you need specific design tokens or font pairings.
